      "q": "How much does Sikorsky Aircraft make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Sikorsky Aircraft made $2.9B from federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Sikorsky recorded 11,960 awards with an average award size of $242K, and obligations fell 40.1% year over year. Historical annual obligations include FY21 $4.9B, FY22 $3.4B, FY23 $5.3B, FY24 $4.8B, and FY25 $4.8B."
